{
  "id": "P13",
  "format": "posting-scenario/v1",
  "name": "A user-created account: create, post to it, trial balance, rename without altering history, frozen code and parent",
  "rules": ["COA/maintenance@1", "JOURNAL_VOUCHER_POSTED@1", "REPORT/trial-balance@1", "REPORT/account-ledger@1"],
  "source": "docs/posting-rules/coa-standard.md",
  "governedBy": [
    "Product Owner scope decision, 2026-09-29 (users may add accounts in the MVP)",
    "coa-standard.md §5 amendment and §8 (Accounting seat, 2026-09-29, M2-C)",
    "NON_NEGOTIABLES rules 2, 4, 9, 17"
  ],
  "executableFrom": "M2-C",
  "status": "PENDING. Specified and hand-computed by the Accounting seat, 2026-09-29 (M2-C). Not executable until migration 018 (column-scoped UPDATE, protected-row and posted-immutability triggers) and the kernel's account create/edit functions exist, and the runner learns the 'account' step verb.",
  "description": [
    "Today is 2026-09-27 (Asia/Karachi). All FY2027 periods OPEN. Tenant GOLDEN_A on standard-v1:",
    "6 headers + 19 postable = 25 accounts before step 1.",
    "The acting user holds account.manage and voucher.post.",
    "",
    "Step 1 creates 6600 'Security Services' under 6000 Operating Expenses.",
    "  type EXPENSE (inherited from 6000), normalBalance DEBIT (derived), POSTABLE, control NONE,",
    "  role null, restricted false, active, version 0. No journal entry. 1 audit record. 26 accounts.",
    "Steps 2–7 are invalid creates. Each writes nothing, so the count stays 26:",
    "  2 code 6600 again                       ACCOUNT_CODE_TAKEN",
    "  3 name 'rent' (6200 is 'Rent')           ACCOUNT_NAME_TAKEN (case-insensitive)",
    "  4 code 1400 under 6000                  ACCOUNT_CODE_OUT_OF_RANGE (block is 6001–6999)",
    "  5 parent 6100 (a POSTABLE account)      ACCOUNT_PARENT_NOT_HEADER",
    "  6 controlKind 'AR' in the request       PAYLOAD_INVALID (not a create field)",
    "  7 code '66A0'                           ACCOUNT_CODE_FORMAT",
    "",
    "Step 8, JV-2027-000001, 2026-09-01: Dr 1110 100000.0000 / Cr 3100 100000.0000.",
    "Step 9, JV-2027-000002, 2026-09-10: Dr 6600 25000.0000 / Cr 1110 25000.0000.",
    "  Σ Dr = Σ Cr = 25000.0000. 6600 passes every manual-JV test (postable, active, not control, not restricted).",
    "",
    "Step 10, by hand, TB as of 2026-09-27:",
    "  1110  +100000.0000 − 25000.0000 = 75000.0000 Dr",
    "  3100  100000.0000 Cr",
    "  6600  +25000.0000               = 25000.0000 Dr",
    "  Σ Dr 75000.0000 + 25000.0000 = 100000.0000 = Σ Cr 100000.0000",
    "  Account ledger 6600, 2026-09-01..2026-09-27: opening 0.0000; JV-2027-000002 Dr 25000.0000,",
    "  running 0.0000 + 25000.0000 = 25000.0000; closing 25000.0000.",
    "",
    "Step 11 renames 6600 to 'Security and Guard Services' (expectedVersion 0 → version 1). 1 audit record",
    "  carrying the before and after names. No journal entry.",
    "Step 12 proves that history is unaltered. JV-2027-000002's lines are byte-for-byte what step 9 wrote:",
    "  the same account id (the one created in step 1) and the same amounts. The TB figures are identical to step 10,",
    "  and only 6600's displayed name has changed. Journal entry count is still 2. The ledger figures are identical to step 10.",
    "Steps 13–17 are rejected edits. Nothing is written, and 6600 stays code 6600, version 1:",
    "  13 code 6600 → 6650              ACCOUNT_HAS_POSTINGS",
    "  14 parent 6000 → 5000, code 5600 ACCOUNT_HAS_POSTINGS",
    "  15 rename with expectedVersion 0 ACCOUNT_VERSION_CONFLICT (current is 1)",
    "  16 rename 1200 (AR control)      ACCOUNT_PROTECTED",
    "  17 rename 6000 (header)          ACCOUNT_PROTECTED",
    "Steps 18–20 show the pre-posting path. Step 18 creates 6700 'Miscellaneous Expense' (27 accounts). Step 19",
    "  re-codes it to 6710. Step 20 re-parents it to 5000 as 5710. It is allowed because the account has no journal line",
    "  and 5000 is also EXPENSE, so the type stays EXPENSE. 3 audit records in all.",
    "Step 21: final TB identical to step 10. 5710 has no activity, so it has no row. Σ Dr = Σ Cr = 100000.0000.",
    "  Journal entry count 2; rounding account 0.0000."
  ],
  "fixture": {
    "coa": "standard-v1",
    "timezone": "Asia/Karachi",
    "fiscalYearStartMonth": 7,
    "today": "2026-09-27",
    "periods": { "fiscalYear": 2027, "status": "all OPEN" },
    "tenants": ["GOLDEN_A"],
    "actor": { "tenant": "GOLDEN_A", "permissions": ["account.view", "account.manage", "voucher.post", "voucher.view", "report.financial"] }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "create",
      "payload": { "code": "6600", "name": "Security Services", "parent": "6000" },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "CREATED",
        "account": {
          "code": "6600",
          "name": "Security Services",
          "parent": "6000",
          "type": "EXPENSE",
          "normalBalance": "DEBIT",
          "kind": "POSTABLE",
          "controlKind": "NONE",
          "role": null,
          "restricted": false,
          "isActive": true,
          "version": 0
        },
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "auditRecordsWritten": 1,
        "auditAction": "ACCOUNT_CREATED",
        "accountsAfter": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "create",
      "payload": { "code": "6600", "name": "Guard Services", "parent": "6000" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_CODE_TAKEN", "accountsAfter": 26, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "create",
      "payload": { "code": "6610", "name": "rent", "parent": "6000" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_NAME_TAKEN", "accountsAfter": 26, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "create",
      "payload": { "code": "1400", "name": "Petty Cash", "parent": "6000" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_CODE_OUT_OF_RANGE", "accountsAfter": 26, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "create",
      "payload": { "code": "6150", "name": "Overtime", "parent": "6100" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_PARENT_NOT_HEADER", "accountsAfter": 26, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "create",
      "payload": { "code": "1210", "name": "Accounts Receivable — Other", "parent": "1000", "controlKind": "AR" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "PAYLOAD_INVALID", "accountsAfter": 26, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "create",
      "payload": { "code": "66A0", "name": "Security Deposits Expense", "parent": "6000" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_CODE_FORMAT", "accountsAfter": 26, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "JOURNAL_VOUCHER_POSTED",
      "idempotencyKey": "p13-capital",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-01",
      "payload": {
        "narration": "Owner's opening capital in cash",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "100000.0000" },
          { "account": "3100", "credit": "100000.0000" }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JV-2027-000001",
        "period": "2026-09",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "100000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "3100", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "100000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "100000.0000", "credit": "100000.0000" },
        "auditRecordsWritten": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 9,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "JOURNAL_VOUCHER_POSTED",
      "idempotencyKey": "p13-guards",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-10",
      "payload": {
        "narration": "September guard services, paid in cash",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "6600", "debit": "25000.0000" },
          { "account": "1110", "credit": "25000.0000" }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JV-2027-000002",
        "period": "2026-09",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "6600", "debit": "25000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "25000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "25000.0000", "credit": "25000.0000" },
        "auditRecordsWritten": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 10,
      "do": "assert",
      "trialBalance": {
        "asOf": "2026-09-27",
        "rows": [
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "75000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "3100", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "100000.0000" },
          { "account": "6600", "name": "Security Services", "debit": "25000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "100000.0000", "credit": "100000.0000" }
      },
      "accountLedger": {
        "account": "6600",
        "from": "2026-09-01",
        "to": "2026-09-27",
        "opening": "0.0000",
        "lines": [
          { "entryNumber": "JV-2027-000002", "date": "2026-09-10", "debit": "25000.0000", "credit": "0.0000", "running": "25000.0000" }
        ],
        "closing": "25000.0000"
      },
      "journalEntryCount": 2
    },
    {
      "step": 11,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "edit",
      "account": "6600",
      "expectedVersion": 0,
      "changes": { "name": "Security and Guard Services" },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "UPDATED",
        "account": { "code": "6600", "name": "Security and Guard Services", "parent": "6000", "type": "EXPENSE", "version": 1 },
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "auditRecordsWritten": 1,
        "auditAction": "ACCOUNT_UPDATED",
        "auditChanges": { "name": { "before": "Security Services", "after": "Security and Guard Services" }, "version": { "before": 0, "after": 1 } }
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 12,
      "do": "assert",
      "$comment": "Rename alters no history. Lines hold the account id (rule 17), so the entry is unchanged and only the label on the report moves.",
      "journalEntry": {
        "entryNumber": "JV-2027-000002",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "6600", "accountIdIsStep1Id": true, "debit": "25000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "25000.0000" }
        ],
        "status": "POSTED"
      },
      "trialBalance": {
        "asOf": "2026-09-27",
        "rows": [
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "75000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "3100", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "100000.0000" },
          { "account": "6600", "name": "Security and Guard Services", "debit": "25000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "100000.0000", "credit": "100000.0000" }
      },
      "accountLedger": {
        "account": "6600",
        "from": "2026-09-01",
        "to": "2026-09-27",
        "opening": "0.0000",
        "lines": [
          { "entryNumber": "JV-2027-000002", "date": "2026-09-10", "debit": "25000.0000", "credit": "0.0000", "running": "25000.0000" }
        ],
        "closing": "25000.0000"
      },
      "journalEntryCount": 2
    },
    {
      "step": 13,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "edit",
      "account": "6600",
      "expectedVersion": 1,
      "changes": { "code": "6650" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_HAS_POSTINGS", "accountAfter": { "code": "6600", "version": 1 }, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 14,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "edit",
      "account": "6600",
      "expectedVersion": 1,
      "changes": { "parent": "5000", "code": "5600" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_HAS_POSTINGS", "accountAfter": { "code": "6600", "parent": "6000", "version": 1 }, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 15,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "edit",
      "account": "6600",
      "expectedVersion": 0,
      "changes": { "name": "Guarding" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_VERSION_CONFLICT", "accountAfter": { "name": "Security and Guard Services", "version": 1 }, "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 16,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "edit",
      "account": "1200",
      "expectedVersion": 0,
      "changes": { "name": "Debtors" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_PROTECTED", "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 17,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "edit",
      "account": "6000",
      "expectedVersion": 0,
      "changes": { "name": "Overheads" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "REJECTED", "error": "ACCOUNT_PROTECTED", "auditRecordsWritten": 0 }
    },
    {
      "step": 18,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "create",
      "payload": { "code": "6700", "name": "Miscellaneous Expense", "parent": "6000" },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "CREATED",
        "account": { "code": "6700", "type": "EXPENSE", "normalBalance": "DEBIT", "controlKind": "NONE", "role": null, "version": 0 },
        "auditRecordsWritten": 1,
        "accountsAfter": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 19,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "edit",
      "account": "6700",
      "expectedVersion": 0,
      "changes": { "code": "6710" },
      "expect": { "outcome": "UPDATED", "account": { "code": "6710", "parent": "6000", "version": 1 }, "auditRecordsWritten": 1 }
    },
    {
      "step": 20,
      "do": "account",
      "action": "edit",
      "account": "6710",
      "expectedVersion": 1,
      "changes": { "parent": "5000", "code": "5710" },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "UPDATED",
        "account": { "code": "5710", "parent": "5000", "type": "EXPENSE", "version": 2 },
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "auditRecordsWritten": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 21,
      "do": "assert",
      "trialBalance": {
        "asOf": "2026-09-27",
        "rows": [
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "75000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "3100", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "100000.0000" },
          { "account": "6600", "name": "Security and Guard Services", "debit": "25000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "100000.0000", "credit": "100000.0000" }
      },
      "journalEntryCount": 2,
      "accountCount": 27,
      "roundingAccountBalance": "0.0000"
    }
  ]
}
